msgid "TMG import failed"
msgstr "TMG-import misslyckades"

msgid ""
"The current Family Tree is not empty.\n"
"\n"
"Please create a new empty Family Tree before importing a TMG backup file."
msgstr ""
"Det aktuella släktträdet är inte tomt.\n"
"\n"
"Skapa ett nytt tomt släktträd innan du importerar en TMG-säkerhetskopia."

msgid ""
"The TMG backup file could not be read: PJC version information is missing or "
"unreadable.\n"
"\n"
"Please ensure you are using a backup created by TMG 9.02 or later "
"(PjcVersion >= 11.0)."
msgstr ""
"TMG-säkerhetskopifilen kunde inte läsas: PJC-versionsinformation saknas "
"eller är oläslig.\n"
"\n"
"Se till att du använder en säkerhetskopia som skapats av TMG 9.02 eller "
"senare (PjcVersion >= 11.0)."

msgid "TMG version not supported"
msgstr "TMG-version stöds inte"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"This backup was created with an older version of TMG (PjcVersion %(ver)s, "
"equivalent to TMG 9.01 or earlier).\n"
"\n"
"Please upgrade your TMG project to version 9.05 and create a new backup, "
"then import again.\n"
"\n"
"See: https://gramps-project.org/wiki/index.php/"
"Addon:TMGimporter#Before_Import_From_TMG_Backup_file"
msgstr ""
"Denna säkerhetskopia skapades med en äldre version av TMG (PjcVersion "
"%(ver)s, motsvarande TMG 9.01 eller tidigare).\n"
"\n"
"Uppgradera ditt TMG-projekt till version 9.05 och skapa en ny "
"säkerhetskopia, importera sedan igen.\n"
"\n"
"Se: https://gramps-project.org/wiki/index.php/"
"Addon:TMGimporter#Before_Import_From_TMG_Backup_file"

msgid ""
"No datasets were found in this TMG backup file.\n"
"\n"
"The backup may be corrupt or empty."
msgstr ""
"Inga dataset hittades i denna TMG-säkerhetskopia.\n"
"\n"
"Säkerhetskopian kan vara skadad eller tom."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(filename)s does not appear to be a valid TMG backup file.\n"
"\n"
"The file must be a TMG backup archive (*.SQZ) containing a project "
"configuration file (.PJC).\n"
"\n"
"Ensure the file was created by TMG version 5.x or later."
msgstr ""
"%(filename)s verkar inte vara en giltig TMG-säkerhetskopia.\n"
"\n"
"Filen måste vara ett TMG-säkerhetskopiaarkiv (*.SQZ) som innehåller en "
"projektkonfigurationsfil (.PJC).\n"
"\n"
"Se till att filen skapades med TMG version 5.x eller senare."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Directly importing from TMG files is not supported\n"
"by the TMG Importer Addon.\n"
"\n"
"You need to use an backup copy of the TMG project(*.sqz)\n"
"\n"
"Ensure that your TMG project was created by:\n"
"TMG version 5.x or greater.\n"
"\n"
"Your file:\n"
"*.PJC - Project Configuration File for TMG 5.0 to TMG 9.05\n"
"\n"
"Please refer to:\n"
"%(gramps_wiki_import_pjc_direct_url)s"
msgstr ""
"Direkt import från TMG-filer stöds inte\n"
"av TMG-import-tillägget.\n"
"\n"
"Du behöver använda en säkerhetskopia av TMG-projektet(*.sqz)\n"
"\n"
"Säkerställ att ditt TMG-projekt skapades av:\n"
"TMG version 5.x eller högre.\n"
"\n"
"Din fil:\n"
"*.PJC - projektkonfigurationsfil för TMG 5.0 till TMG 9.05\n"
"\n"
"Vänligen hänvisa till:\n"
"%(gramps_wiki_import_pjc_direct_url)s"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Directly importing from TMG files is not supported\n"
"by the TMG Importer Addon.\n"
"\n"
"You need to use an backup copy of TMG project(*.sqz)\n"
"\n"
"Ensure that your TMG project was created by:\n"
"TMG version 5.x or greater.\n"
"\n"
"Your file:\n"
"*.TMG - Version Control File for TMG 2.0 to TMG 4.0d\n"
"\n"
"Please refer to:\n"
"%(gramps_wiki_import_pjc_direct_url)s"
msgstr ""
"Direkt import från TMG-filer stöds inte\n"
"av TMG-import-tillägget.\n"
"\n"
"Du behöver använda en säkerhetskopia av TMG-projektet(*.sqz)\n"
"\n"
"Säkerställ att ditt TMG-projekt skapades av:\n"
"TMG version 5.x eller högre.\n"
"\n"
"Din fil:\n"
"*.TMG - versionskontrollfil för TMG 2.0 till TMG 4.0d\n"
"\n"
"Vänligen hänvisa till:\n"
"%(gramps_wiki_import_pjc_direct_url)s"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Directly importing from TMG files is not supported\n"
"by the TMG Importer Addon.\n"
"\n"
"You need to use an backup copy of TMG project(*.sqz)\n"
"\n"
"Ensure that your TMG project was created by:\n"
"TMG version 5.x or greater.\n"
"\n"
"Your file:\n"
"*.VER - Version Control File for TMG 1.2 and earlier\n"
"\n"
"Please refer to:\n"
"%(gramps_wiki_import_pjc_direct_url)s"
msgstr ""
"Direkt import från TMG-filer stöds inte\n"
"av TMG-import-tillägget.\n"
"\n"
"Du behöver använda en säkerhetskopia av TMG-projektet(*.sqz)\n"
"\n"
"Säkerställ att ditt TMG-projekt skapades av:\n"
"TMG version 5.x eller högre.\n"
"\n"
"Din fil:\n"
"*.VER - versionskontrollfil för TMG 1.2 och tidigare\n"
"\n"
"Vänligen hänvisa till:\n"
"%(gramps_wiki_import_pjc_direct_url)s"

msgid "TMG Project Backup"
msgstr "Säkerhetskopiera TMG-projekt"

msgid "Import TMG project files"
msgstr "Importera TMG-projektfiler"

msgid "TMG Unsupported"
msgstr "TMG stöds inte"

msgid "TMG Importer"
msgstr "TMG-importör"

msgid "Unreleased Addon - Work In Progress"
msgstr "Outgivet tillägg - Pågående arbete"

msgid ""
"Wholly Genes - The Master Genealogist (TMG) Importer\n"
"\n"
"Select the TMG Data Set you wish to import."
msgstr ""
"Wholly Genes - The Master Genealogist (TMG) importverktyg\n"
"\n"
"Välj datauppsättningen från TMG som du önskar importera."

msgid "Data Set Name"
msgstr "Namn på datauppsättning"

msgid "_Import TMG Data Set"
msgstr "_Importera TMG datauppsättning"
